<title>USA: U.S. Treasuries close higher on Feb inflation drop.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasuries close higher on Feb inflation drop.</headline>
<text>
<p>*US Treasuries end modestly higher on February inflation drop.</p>
<p>*Traders say odds of Fed rate hike in March slip slightly.</p>
<p>*Early data lifted bonds. Feb PPI -0.4 pct, steeper drop than economists expected. Feb industrial production +0.5 pct, as anticipated. Capacity use at non-inflationary 83.3 pct.</p>
</text>
